# scripts/opcount (from the repository root, NAME ../benchmarks/apifirst/session/ergo):
# `sessionbench session` runs a script of N lines on standard input
# through api.Session and the generated command line of counter.Counter
# (AF3); the cost of one line is the slope between the two sizes. The
# input is `sessionbench gen N`. The control is the CLI control's
# `session`: a hand word splitter and the hand command line of spec §3's
# CLI row, in one loop over standard input.
unit line
sizes 20000 220000
input self gen {n}
args session
control benchmarks/apifirst/cli/control
